ght: .95;\n    }\n    .copy {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 38px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.36;\n      letter-spacing: .1px;\n    }\n    .copy p {\n      margin: 0 0 2px;\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n    .dropcap {\n      float: left;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      margin: 2px 2px 0 0;\n      font-weight: 900;\n    }\n    .leftcopy, .rightcopy { min-width: 0; }\n    .joist-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 23px;\n      margin-top: -14px;\n      margin-left: 226px;\n      width: 248px;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .joist-box {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: 3px;\n    }\n    .joist-image {\n      height: 101px;\n      margin-bottom: 5px;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(25deg, transparent 40%, #ddd 41% 43%, transparent 44%) center/100% 100%,\n        linear-gradient(155deg, transparent 42%, #bbb 43% 45%, transparent 46%) center/100% 100%,\n        linear-gradient(10deg, #111, #292929);\n      border: 1px solid #333;\n      color: #eee;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n    .bottom-brand {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .brand-name {\n      font-family: Impact, \"Arial Black\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 46px;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      color: #333;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px #eee, 2px 2px #555;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .brand-bottom {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .seal {\n      width: 66px;\n      height: 66px;\n      margin-right: 14px;\n      border: 3px solid #333;\n      transform: perspective(100px) rotateY(-7deg);\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.05;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .offices {\n      flex: 1;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 1.17;\n      letter-spacing: .25px;\n    }\n    .offices strong { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .8px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"topline\">\n      <div>16</div>\n      <div class=\"issue\">American Builder, July 1935.</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"arched-title\">\n        <span>KALMAN</span><span>STEEL</span><span>JOISTS</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder man-art\">[Illustration: man in suit]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder houses-art\">[Illustration: houses, trees, and street]</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <h1 class=\"script-heading\">bring added values to any home</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"copy\">\n      <div class=\"leftcopy\">\n        <p><span class=\"dropcap\">W</span>HILE fire-safety ranks first among the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists, they bring additional values that appeal to any prospective home-builder.</p>\n        <p>The combination of Kalman Steel Joists with concrete floor slab and plaster makes a floor structure that, while forming an impassable barrier to fire, transmits very little sound and vibration, preventing noises overhead from disturbing occupants of rooms below. A floor structure that cannot shrink to cause cracks where walls and floor meet, and that is immune to the dreaded termite, whose ravages are spreading rapidly.</p>\n        <p>These advantages, which make a difference in the building cost of only a few cents a square foot, provide the owner with a dwelling that is more</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rightcopy\">\n        <p>livable. They make his investment sounder, because his home—which often represents the savings of years—is less subject to swift obsolescence, will need fewer repairs.</p>\n        <p>Kalman Steel Joists in no way complicate the builder’s work. Often they simplify it. These joists require no cutting or fitting. They reach the site in the exact lengths needed and are quickly installed and the concrete poured.</p>\n        <p>Tell the prospective home-owner about the advantages of Kalman Steel Joists. The fact that he may have in mind a relatively small dwelling offers no obstacle to their use. Kalman Joists can be applied as economically to a six-room home as to a large, pretentious one. They are of course adaptable to any style of architecture.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"joist-row\">\n      <div class=\"joist-box\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder joist-image\">[Product photograph: steel joist]</div>\n        KALMAN JOIST\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"joist-box\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder joist-image\">[Product photograph: steel joist]</div>\n        MACMAR JOIST\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"bottom-brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-name\">KALMAN BUILDING STEEL</div>\n      <div class=\"brand-bottom\">\n        <div class=\"seal\">BETHLEHEM<br>STEEL</div>\n        <div class=\"offices\">\n          <strong>KALMAN STEEL CORPORATION,</strong> <em>Subsidiary of Bethlehem Steel Corporation. General Offices: Bethlehem, Pa. District Offices:</em> Albany,<br>\n          Atlanta, Baltimore, Boston, Buffalo, Chicago, Cincinnati, Cleveland, Detroit, Houston, Milwaukee, Minneapolis, New York, Philadelphia,<br>\n          Pittsburgh, St. Louis, St. Paul, Syracuse, Washington. <em>Pacific Coast Distributor:</em> Pacific Coast Steel Corporation, San Francisco, Seattle,<br>\n          Los Angeles, Portland, Honolulu. <em>Export Distributor:</em> Bethlehem Steel Export Corporation, New York.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
